# Odo auto-land verify gate (M16 / O-1 v2).
# The daemon runs the FIRST non-comment line as a shell command at a run's
# worktree root; a diff may land without a human only if it exits 0.
# Diffs touching THIS file are blocked by the supply-chain gate (self-
# modification always requires a human).
#
# Path-scoped verify (Fix 3): glob-prefixed lines run when ALL diff paths
# match the glob. The bare fallback line runs for any other diff.
gui/**: cd gui && npx tsc --noEmit && npx playwright test --reporter=line
go build ./... && go vet ./... && go test ./...
